  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "The Edo period has ended, and former samurai Haruyasu is adrift in a strange new world. Not even the promise of rebellion can cure him of his desire for death. But after an assassination gone wrong, Haruyasu finds himself at the mercy of his intended victim's bodyguard, an intriguing young woman with the power to heal–so intriguing, in fact, that he decides he wants to live in order to learn more about her. But what will she ask in return for saving his life?",
   "ja": "明治、東京。幕末に死に損ねた武士・春安は、死に場所を求めて大久保利通の暗殺計画に手を出すが「不死」の力を持つ少女・シノに暗殺を阻まれる。ようやく死ねると思った春安だったが、シノは自らの「不死の母を殺し、自分も死ぬ」という宿願を果たす為に春安を助け眷属とする。しかし、母殺しを目指す中で明治政府、不死の兄弟たちが立ちふさがり…!?"
  },
